                "path": "CLONE_SPEC.md",
                "lines": "78-83",
                "quote": "Klim Type Foundry"
              },
              {
                "path": "CLONE_SPEC.md",
                "lines": "78-83",
                "quote": "They are commercial fonts. Check the licence before shipping."
